Aerie-Purpose: Add the Filter Engine toolbar button (blocked count and a per-site switch) to the browser toolbar.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/views/toolbar/toolbar_view.cc, chrome/browser/ui/views/toolbar/BUILD.gn
Aerie-Kind: hook

One AddChildView() after the performance intervention button. The button is in
chrome/browser/ui/views/aerie_adblock (the overlay). It is not a pinned action
yet; the sidebar and the command bar take over in M2 and M3.

